delta (turn_detector - fixed): median -168ms  p90 -172ms  max -223ms  false cuts +3

A median win with a worse max is a regression in conversation: the tail is
what gets noticed. And a median win bought with even one extra false cut is
not a win at all.

response-ready = end of speech -> LLM call. Under 'punctuation' the STT pass is paid
inside the silence wait rather than after it, so the saving is larger than the
change in timeout alone. Under 'turn_detector' STT is paid after the cut, same
as 'fixed' — only the cutoff itself changes.
